{"case_id": "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q8", "domain": "career", "question": "命主事业上的特色？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "八字分析：日主戊土生于丑月，得时得地，又得时柱丁巳印星生扶，身强无疑。天干双透辛金伤官，聪明外露，口才佳。月柱辛丑伤官坐劫财，年柱辛亥伤官坐财，时干丁火正印透出，构成伤官配印之格，主文化、公职之象。然伤官过旺，无官星明制，亥中甲木七杀被辛金盖头克伐，官星受损。地支丑戌相刑，刑入日柱夫妻宫，且丑为库，戌为火库，刑则生事端，主官非、纠纷。大运推演，逆排至庚子、己亥、戊戌、丁酉等。丁酉运（约34-43岁），酉金合丑化金，伤官猖獗，丁火正印虚浮被耗，印星无力约束，极易因言行触犯法律。运支酉金又与年支亥水相害，加剧官星之伤，正应刑事案件提早退休之象。其余选项：A无畜牧行业显象，C建筑工人与伤官佩印不符，D商人之象无强财支撑，且伤官有印多近贵。故选B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "chaozhou_male_19720108_P002-Q8", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P0_G0\\details_2024_b1a_prime_R2_P0_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 18519, "response_id": "788cbda2-6603-496e-a6d8-f673af34fbe3", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 228, "completion_tokens": 1251, "total_tokens": 1479, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 958}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 100}}
